('pacing','hook_in_1_5s','Hook inside 1.5 seconds','the hook must be visible and readable by 1.5 seconds, before any logo or intro','Viewers decide in about two seconds.',ARRAY[]::text[],'Public 2026 reel guides (Opus Pro, UpGrow, SocialPilot, Async, Buffer)'),
('pacing','cut_every_2_3s','A change every 2-3 seconds','a new visual, crop, zoom or text beat every 1.5-3 seconds; no static shot longer than 4 seconds','Static shots lose viewers.',ARRAY[]::text[],'Public 2026 reel guides (Opus Pro, UpGrow, SocialPilot, Async, Buffer)'),
('pacing','text_1_2s','Text beats','one on-screen text element every 1-2 seconds; never a paragraph','Reading time must fit the beat.',ARRAY[]::text[],'Public 2026 reel guides (Opus Pro, UpGrow, SocialPilot, Async, Buffer)'),
('pacing','length_by_goal','Length by goal','entertaining 7-15s; teaching 15-30s; anything over 45s only with exceptional value','Shorter reels keep higher average retention.',ARRAY[]::text[],'Public 2026 reel guides (Opus Pro, UpGrow, SocialPilot, Async, Buffer)'),
('pacing','payoff_last_2s','Payoff in last 2 seconds','deliver the promised payoff or the call to action in the last 2 seconds','Ending strong lifts completion.',ARRAY[]::text[],'Public 2026 reel guides (Opus Pro, UpGrow, SocialPilot, Async, Buffer)'),
('pacing','three_to_five_beats','3-5 beats','after the hook, 3-5 key beats with a time budget each','Clear structure beats rambling.',ARRAY[]::text[],'Public 2026 reel guides (Opus Pro, UpGrow, SocialPilot, Async, Buffer)'),
('pacing','sound_off_first','Works with sound off','every reel must make full sense with the sound off (over 85% watch muted)','Most viewers do not hear audio.',ARRAY[]::text[],'Public 2026 reel guides (Opus Pro, UpGrow, SocialPilot, Async, Buffer)'),
('pacing','open_loop','Open loop','promise something in the first line and pay it off later, not at once','Curiosity keeps eyes on screen.',ARRAY[]::text[],'Public 2026 reel guides (Opus Pro, UpGrow, SocialPilot, Async, Buffer)'),
('pacing','pattern_interrupt','Pattern interrupt','change the angle, scale or colour block right before attention would drop (around 4-6 seconds)','Resets attention.',ARRAY[]::text[],'Short-form editing practice'),
('pacing','one_idea','One idea only','one reel teaches or shows one thing','Focus raises completion.',ARRAY[]::text[],'Public 2026 reel guides (Opus Pro, UpGrow, SocialPilot, Async, Buffer)'),
('caption','word_highlight','Word-by-word with one highlight','show 2-5 words at a time, synced to the voice; highlight one key word per line in the accent colour','Every reference reel uses this.',ARRAY[]::text[],'Founder''s reference reels and posts, Nov 2026'),
('caption','size_and_contrast','Large and high contrast','bold sans-serif, large enough to read on a phone; white on dark or black on light; box or stroke on busy backgrounds','Readability.',ARRAY[]::text[],'Public 2026 reel guides (Opus Pro, UpGrow, SocialPilot, Async, Buffer)'),
('caption','center_third','Centre third, safe zones','keep captions in the centre third; stay out of the top and bottom interface areas and away from faces','Platform UI covers the edges.',ARRAY[]::text[],'Public 2026 reel guides (Opus Pro, UpGrow, SocialPilot, Async, Buffer)'),
('caption','hold_2_4s','Hold 2-4 seconds','keep each caption block on screen 2-4 seconds depending on word count','Matches reading speed.',ARRAY[]::text[],'Public 2026 reel guides (Opus Pro, UpGrow, SocialPilot, Async, Buffer)'),
('caption','simple_motion','Simple motion','a subtle pop or fade; no heavy animation','Heavy motion distracts.',ARRAY[]::text[],'Public 2026 reel guides (Opus Pro, UpGrow, SocialPilot, Async, Buffer)'),
('caption','stamp_emphasis','Stamp for emphasis','use a sticker or stamp (GALAT, OFF, FREE) for the single most important word of the reel','Visual verdict reinforces the point.',ARRAY[]::text[],'Founder''s reference reels and posts, Nov 2026'),
('caption','two_tone_headline','Two-tone headline','static posts: label pill, big headline with one phrase in the accent colour, one big number or quote, lots of empty space','Pattern in the founder''s best posts.',ARRAY[]::text[],'Founder''s reference reels and posts, Nov 2026'),
('caption','burned_in','Burned-in, branded','captions are part of the video in the brand font and colours, not platform auto captions','Consistent brand look.',ARRAY[]::text[],'Public 2026 reel guides (Opus Pro, UpGrow, SocialPilot, Async, Buffer)'),
('cta','send_to_friend','Send to someone','''Send this to someone who [specific situation]''','DM shares are among the strongest reach signals.',ARRAY[]::text[],'Public 2026 reel guides (Opus Pro, UpGrow, SocialPilot, Async, Buffer)'),
('cta','save_for_later','Save for later','''Save this for when you [specific moment]''','Saves signal lasting value.',ARRAY[]::text[],'Public 2026 reel guides (Opus Pro, UpGrow, SocialPilot, Async, Buffer)'),
('cta','comment_keyword','Comment a keyword','''Comment [WORD] and I will send you [thing]''. Use only when the brand can really deliver the thing','High comment rate; needs a reply path.',ARRAY[]::text[],'Founder''s reference reels and posts, Nov 2026'),
('cta','follow_part_2','Follow for part 2','end on a cliffhanger and promise the next part','Brings viewers back.',ARRAY[]::text[],'Public 2026 reel guides (Opus Pro, UpGrow, SocialPilot, Async, Buffer)'),
('cta','question_to_comment','Ask a real question','end with one easy question: ''Which would you pick?''','Easy to answer, so more comments.',ARRAY[]::text[],'Public 2026 reel guides (Opus Pro, UpGrow, SocialPilot, Async, Buffer)'),
('cta','whatsapp_us','WhatsApp us','''WhatsApp us on [number] to [specific next step]''','Direct path for Indian small business.',ARRAY[]::text[],'Public 2026 reel guides (Opus Pro, UpGrow, SocialPilot, Async, Buffer)'),
('cta','book_now','Book or visit','''Book [specific slot] on the link in bio'' with a real date','Clear conversion.',ARRAY[]::text[],'Public 2026 reel guides (Opus Pro, UpGrow, SocialPilot, Async, Buffer)'),
('cta','tag_a_friend','Tag a friend','''Tag the one who always [relatable habit]''','Social reach, use sparingly.',ARRAY[]::text[],'Public 2026 reel guides (Opus Pro, UpGrow, SocialPilot, Async, Buffer)'),
('cta','try_today','Try it today','give one tiny action the viewer can do right now','Low friction.',ARRAY[]::text[],'Public 2026 reel guides (Opus Pro, UpGrow, SocialPilot, Async, Buffer)'),
('cta','soft_none','No hard CTA','end on the payoff with the brand name; no ask','Avoids sales fatigue; good for trust posts.',ARRAY[]::text[],'Public 2026 reel guides (Opus Pro, UpGrow, SocialPilot, Async, Buffer)'),
('ending','seamless_loop','Seamless loop','for reels under 15 seconds, make the last frame flow into the first so it replays without a seam','Rewatches add watch time.',ARRAY[]::text[],'Public 2026 reel guides (Opus Pro, UpGrow, SocialPilot, Async, Buffer)'),
('ending','cliffhanger','Cliffhanger','stop just before the final reveal and promise it in part 2','Drives follows and returns.',ARRAY[]::text[],'Public 2026 reel guides (Opus Pro, UpGrow, SocialPilot, Async, Buffer)'),
('ending','callback','Callback to the hook','end by echoing the first line with a new meaning','Satisfying close.',ARRAY[]::text[],'Public 2026 reel guides (Opus Pro, UpGrow, SocialPilot, Async, Buffer)'),
('ending','question_end','Question end','finish on a question that invites an answer in the comments','Starts a thread.',ARRAY[]::text[],'Public 2026 reel guides (Opus Pro, UpGrow, SocialPilot, Async, Buffer)'),
('ending','number_end','Number end','end on the single number that proves the point','Memorable.',ARRAY[]::text[],'Public 2026 reel guides (Opus Pro, UpGrow, SocialPilot, Async, Buffer)'),
('audio','always_audio','Always include audio','a voice-over, original audio or a licensed track is on every reel; silent reels underperform','Reels with audio are favoured.',ARRAY[]::text[],'Public 2026 reel guides (Opus Pro, UpGrow, SocialPilot, Async, Buffer)'),
('audio','voice_first','Voice leads','the voice-over is the main track; music sits well below it','Clear message.',ARRAY[]::text[],'Public 2026 reel guides (Opus Pro, UpGrow, SocialPilot, Async, Buffer)'),
('audio','no_watermark','No watermarks','never reuse clips with another app''s watermark or logo','Reposts with watermarks are deprioritised.',ARRAY[]::text[],'Public 2026 reel guides (Opus Pro, UpGrow, SocialPilot, Async, Buffer)'),
('audio','original_only','Original content','use the brand''s own footage or properly licensed stock; do not reupload other creators'' videos','Originality is rewarded.',ARRAY[]::text[],'Public 2026 reel guides (Opus Pro, UpGrow, SocialPilot, Async, Buffer)'),
('audio','licensed_music','Licensed music only','use royalty-free or platform-licensed music; avoid copyrighted tracks in brand publishing','Avoids takedowns.',ARRAY[]::text[],'Public 2026 reel guides (Opus Pro, UpGrow, SocialPilot, Async, Buffer)'),
('signal','watch_time','Watch time','the top signal is how much of the reel is watched, in percent and seconds; design for completion','Highest weight in published ranking guidance.',ARRAY[]::text[],'Public 2026 reel guides (Opus Pro, UpGrow, SocialPilot, Async, Buffer)'),
('signal','sends','Sends (DM shares)','shares by DM are a very strong signal for reach beyond followers; write something people want to send to a specific person','Sends drive non-follower reach.',ARRAY[]::text[],'Public 2026 reel guides (Opus Pro, UpGrow, SocialPilot, Async, Buffer)'),
('signal','likes_per_reach','Likes per reach','likes divided by reach matters mostly for followers; make the point likeable, not just informative','Used for connected reach.',ARRAY[]::text[],'Public 2026 reel guides (Opus Pro, UpGrow, SocialPilot, Async, Buffer)'),
('signal','saves','Saves','saves show lasting value; checklists, steps and prices get saved','Signals usefulness.',ARRAY[]::text[],'Public 2026 reel guides (Opus Pro, UpGrow, SocialPilot, Async, Buffer)'),
('signal','originality','Originality','original content is favoured and reposted content is demoted','Platform preference.',ARRAY[]::text[],'Public 2026 reel guides (Opus Pro, UpGrow, SocialPilot, Async, Buffer)'),
('signal','trial_test','Test before posting wide','a hook can be tested on non-followers first (trial reels) before it goes to the audience','Reduces risk.',ARRAY[]::text[],'Public 2026 reel guides (Opus Pro, UpGrow, SocialPilot, Async, Buffer)'),
('india','hinglish_voice','Hinglish when the audience speaks it','write voice-over and captions in natural Hinglish (Roman script) for B2C Indian audiences; mix Hindi and English the way people speak; avoid textbook Hindi','Reads as a person, not an ad.',ARRAY[]::text[],'Founder''s reference reels and posts, Nov 2026'),
('india','rupee_prices','Prices in rupees','state prices and savings in rupees (Rs or ₹), with real numbers','Concrete and local.',ARRAY[]::text[],'Founder''s reference reels and posts, Nov 2026'),
('india','festival_calendar','Festival timing','tie content to Diwali, Dhanteras, Raksha Bandhan, Eid, Holi, Navratri, Ganesh Chaturthi, wedding season and exam season, 2-3 weeks ahead','Demand spikes before festivals.',ARRAY[]::text[],'Founder''s reference reels and posts, Nov 2026'),
('india','whatsapp_trust','WhatsApp as the close','give a WhatsApp number or ''DM to order'' as the next step; show response time honestly','How many Indian small businesses sell.',ARRAY[]::text[],'Founder''s reference reels and posts, Nov 2026'),
('india','cod_and_returns','Trust signals','mention cash on delivery, return policy, real address or years in business when true','Reduces buying fear.',ARRAY[]::text[],'Founder''s reference reels and posts, Nov 2026'),
('india','local_city','Name the city','name the city or area when the business is local (''Jaipur'', ''Koramangala'')','Local search and recognition.',ARRAY[]::text[],'Founder''s reference reels and posts, Nov 2026'),
('india','avoid_tiktok','No TikTok','TikTok is not available in India; do not suggest it','Platform fact.',ARRAY[]::text[],'Founder''s reference reels and posts, Nov 2026'),
('india','relatable_family','Family and festival moments','use relatable family, wedding and festival moments, never stereotypes','High emotional pull in India.',ARRAY[]::text[],'Founder''s reference reels and posts, Nov 2026')
